实现是单文件自包含的，`main(grid)` 按题面解析“多色递增间距标记行 + 唯一竖条”，同时延拓位置序列和颜色循环；`generate_input()` 用输出先行回推输入，并额外校验周期可判定、目标列唯一、步数由高度决定且 `main(inp)` 精确还原预期输出。

已完成验证：
```bash
python - <<'PY'
from importlib.machinery import SourceFileLoader
from pathlib import Path
import hashlib
import numpy as np

p = Path("/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/8/052/2.py")
mod = SourceFileLoader("new_arc_task", str(p)).load_module()
sigs = set()
for i in range(100):
    inp = mod.generate_input()
    out = mod.main(inp)
    assert isinstance(inp, np.ndarray)
    assert isinstance(out, np.ndarray)
    assert inp.ndim == 2 and max(inp.shape) <= 30
    assert out.ndim == 2 and max(out.shape) <= 30
    sigs.add(hashlib.md5(inp.tobytes() + str(inp.shape).encode()).hexdigest())
print("variants", len(sigs))
assert len(sigs) >= 20
PY
python -m py_compile "/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/8/052/2.py"
